Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 07:47:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] feat(evals): opt-in graph_kb arm (graph plus the
 knowledge-factory tools)

graph_kb runs the graph arm with kf_flag / kb_search / kb_read from
kf.agent_tools, imported only for this arm. It reads the flag queue dir
from KF_STATE_DIR (flags.db) and the frozen bundle from KF_BUNDLE_SNAPSHOT
and refuses to run when either is unset. Flags carry run_id
<KF_RUN_PREFIX>__<scenario>__graph_kb__<run> (the prefix is optional: the
factory sets split, eval stamp and seed) and agent_id autorca.
